{"product_id":"iqos-terea-zing-wave","title":"IQOS Terea Zing Wave","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eTEREA ZING WAVE brings a refreshing new dimension to the world of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eterea\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e. Designed exclusively for IQOS ILUMA, this flavor combines crisp menthol with a zing of citrus, offering a cool yet energetic sensation with every puff.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41838501724215,"sku":"Terea Zing Wave - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41838501756983,"sku":"Terea Zing Wave - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-terea-Zing-Wave.jpg?v=1755831419","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-terea-zing-wave","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




